  "term": "FAR",
  "definition": "FAR refers to far-infrared therapy, a non-invasive heat-based intervention. In the source, it is discussed as a possible influence on body blood-flow dynamics and recovery-related processes, but its role in neurological recovery in alcohol dependence is not yet well established.",
